.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cursor-session-healthcheck 1 "" "cursor-session 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cursor\-session\-healthcheck \- Check that session stores can be found and loaded
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcursor\-session healthcheck\fR [\fB\-\-storage\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check that session stores can be found and loaded
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-storage\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read only this location: a home, .cursor, chats, workspace, session or projects directory, a store.db or state.vscdb file, or the directory that holds state.vscdb
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the storage paths in use and the rows, lines and files that were skipped to stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
When to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
.nf
cursor\-session healthcheck
cursor\-session \-v healthcheck
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.RS 4
.nf
0  Success, also when output is cut short by a closed pipe (e.g. `| head`)
1  Error: session not found or deleted while being read, no sessions match (search), unreadable storage, failed healthcheck
2  Usage error: unknown command or flag, invalid value
.fi
.RE
